if; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><font color=\"#212121\" face=\"Noto Sans KR, Nanum Gothic, Helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;1) 원서접수 일정</font></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><font color=\"#212121\" face=\"Noto Sans KR, Nanum Gothic, Helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp; - 1차 모집 : 2022.12.05 (월) 09:00 ~ 12.09 (금) 17:00</font></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><font color=\"#212121\" face=\"Noto Sans KR, Nanum Gothic, Helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp; - 2차 모집 : 2022.12.12 (월) 09:00 ~ 12.16 (금) 17:00</font></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><font color=\"#212121\" face=\"Noto Sans KR, Nanum Gothic, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">&nbsp; - 3차 모집(추가 모집) :&nbsp;</span></font><span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">2022.12.19</span><span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">&nbsp;(월) 09:00 ~ 12.23</span><span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">&nbsp;(금) 17:00</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><font color=\"#212121\" face=\"Noto Sans KR, Nanum Gothic, Helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp; • 접수방법 : 산학교육원(산학협력관 501호)으로 직접 제출</font></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\">&nbsp;2) 제출서류<br></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><font color=\"#212121\" face=\"Noto Sans KR, Nanum Gothic, Helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp; • 연계(융합)전공 이수신청서 (첨부파일의 붙임1)</font></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><font color=\"#212121\" face=\"Noto Sans KR, Nanum Gothic, Helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp; • 스마트공장 융합전공 지원신청서 (첨부파일의 붙임2)</font></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><font color=\"#212121\" face=\"Noto Sans KR, Nanum Gothic, Helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp; • 교내 / 교외활동 증빙자료 (경진대회 및 학술대회 참가 증빙자료, 수상실적 등)</font></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\">&nbsp;3) 유의사항<br></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><font color=\"#212121\" face=\"Noto Sans KR, Nanum Gothic, Helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp; • 지원자격을 반드시 확인하고 접수하여야 하며, 접수 후 지원자격 미달로 확인되면&nbsp;</font>불합격 처리함</p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><font color=\"#212121\" face=\"Noto Sans KR, Nanum Gothic, Helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp; • 신청서의 기재사항이 사실과 다르거나 제출서류의 허위 등 기타 부정한 방법으로&nbsp;</font>합격한 사실이 확인될 경우 합격을 취소함</p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><font color=\"#212121\" face=\"Noto Sans KR, Nanum Gothic, Helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp; • 제출서류의 누락, 작성오류, 기재사항 누락 등으로 인한 불이익은 지원자의 책임임</font></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><font color=\"#212121\" face=\"Noto Sans KR, Nanum Gothic, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><br></font></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><font color=\"#212121\" face=\"Noto Sans KR, Nanum Gothic, Helvetica, sans-serif\">2. 지원자격</font></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><font color=\"#212121\" face=\"Noto Sans KR, Nanum Gothic, Helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;참여학과 소속 3학년 진입생 (복학예정자도 해당)</font></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><font color=\"#212121\" face=\"Noto Sans KR, Nanum Gothic, Helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp; &nbsp;• 참여학과 : 기계시스템공학과, 산업공학부, 컴퓨터공학과, 컴퓨터소프트웨어공학과,</font>&nbsp;전자공학부 참여전공 (전자및전파전공, 전자IT융합전공)</p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><font color=\"#212121\" face=\"Noto Sans KR, Nanum Gothic, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><br></font></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><font color=\"#212121\" face=\"Noto Sans KR, Nanum Gothic, Helvetica, sans-serif\">3. 일정</font></p><div id=\"hwpEditorBoardContent\" class=\"hwp_editor_board_content\" data-hjsonver=\"1.0\" data-jsonlen=\"27753\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"></div><p style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"></p><table width=\"819px\" style=\"width: 819px; border-width: initial; border-style: none; border-color: initial;\"><tbody><tr><td valign=\"middle\" style=\"padding: 1.41pt; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, 돋움, AppleSDGothicNeo, Dotum, &quot;Droid Sans&quot;, arial, sans-serif; width: 204px; height: 0px; border-width: 1.7pt 0.28pt 1.7pt 1.7pt; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background: rgb(221, 221, 221);\"><p class=\"0\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 15.6px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: keep-all; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">구 분</span></p></td><td valign=\"middle\" style=\"padding: 1.41pt; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, 돋움, AppleSDGothicNeo, Dotum, &quot;Droid Sans&quot;, arial, sans-serif; width: 417px; height: 0px; border-width: 1.7pt 0.28pt; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background: rgb(221, 221, 221);\"><p class=\"0\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;